<deviceset name="HANBO_TF_027" prefix="J" uservalue="yes">
<description>HANBO short microSD socket; 4-bit pinout. Exact TF-027-H375 / C22374618. Eight SD contacts, CD, separate upper-left metal/common MT1, and paired shell MT2/MT3. Ground metal feet externally; manufacturer does not specify detect contact truth table. Height is overall, NOT underside clearance.</description>
