<package name="USB_A_SIDE_SHORT_HC_L100_P">
<description>Hong Cheng HC-USB2.0-L100-P / JLC C7501843. Side-standing, flat-lip USB-A receptacle; 10.00 mm depth, 5.72 mm shell width (6.00 mm local body features), 13.65 mm above PCB. Manufacturer Rev A top-view PCB pattern: four 0.80 mm drills at 1.40 mm pitch; two 0.70 x 1.80 mm plated shell slots on 5.42 mm X centers, 2.50 mm ahead of the signal row; central 1.50 x 0.70 mm plated shell slot another 3.05 mm forward. Body center is origin; mouth faces -Y. Explicit 1.22 mm signal copper and 1.60 mm long shell copper are house lands. Layer 46 closed outlines define the plated slots; retain them in fabrication. Pins 1 VBUS, 2 D-, 3 D+, 4 GND; shell pads 5/6/7 common. Catalog model is named L100-W; its 6.32 mm extreme width differs from the 6.00 mm drawing, so manufacturer dimensions govern.</description>
