<package name="TACT_SMD_5.2X5.2">
<description>&lt;b&gt;Tactile switch, 5.2 x 5.2mm SMD, 4-pad&lt;/b&gt; (a.k.a. TS-1187A / 5mm gull-wing tact). Pads at +/-3.0 x +/-1.85mm (3.70mm pitch). Pads sized (1.6 x 0.9mm) to accept the whole family - fits XKB TS-1187A (C318884, JLC Basic, leads 1.0x0.75), G-Switch GT-TZ084B (C29780122, leads 1.58x0.80) and other 5.1/5.2mm 4-pad P3.70 tacts. Left pads (1,3) = one contact, right pads (2,4) = the other; SPST momentary.</description>
<smd name="B1" x="-3" y="1.85" dx="1.6" dy="0.9" layer="1"/>
<smd name="B2" x="3" y="1.85" dx="1.6" dy="0.9" layer="1"/>
