<devicesets>
<deviceset name="ESP32-P4" prefix="U">
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Espressif ESP32-P4 high-performance application SoC&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dual-core 400 MHz HP RISC-V plus LP core, MIPI CSI/DSI, USB 2.0 HS/FS, Ethernet MAC, H.264/JPEG acceleration, and in-package 1.8 V PSRAM. This library entry targets current v3.2-or-later X-series silicon; package pin 54 is VDD_HP_1.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Symbol and pin map: ESP32-P4 Series Datasheet v0.7. Symbol pins XTALP and XTALN correspond to datasheet signals XTAL_P and XTAL_N; the aliases avoid EAGLE interpreting an underscore-N suffix as active-low notation. Footprint geometry cross-checked against Espressif kicad-libraries revision dd76561812ab300351234ba6e0ec1295641796f0 (CC-BY-SA-4.0 with design-output exception).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
