<text x="142.24" y="137.16" size="1.778" layer="98" font="vector">40MHZ CLOCK / RESET / BOOT</text>
<text x="142.24" y="45.97" size="1.016" layer="97" font="vector">BOOT35; C6BOOT36 pulled high; C6_EN34 (default JTAG eFuses).</text>
<text x="142.24" y="44.2" size="1.016" layer="97" font="vector">Crystal CL=10pF: start 15pF each plus estimated 2.5pF stray.</text>
<text x="142.24" y="42.42" size="1.016" layer="97" font="vector">Validate crystal frequency and startup margin on hardware.</text>
<wire x1="139.7" y1="154.94" x2="139.7" y2="256.54" width="0.1524" layer="98" style="shortdash"/>
