<text x="243.84" y="190.5" size="1.778" layer="98" font="vector">CSI 22-PIN FPC</text>
<text x="243.84" y="114.55" size="1.016" layer="97" font="vector">Vertical 0.5mm XFCN F0503-ZV; 0.3mm FPC.</text>
<text x="243.84" y="112.78" size="1.016" layer="97" font="vector">Two MIPI data lanes. Pins 11,12,14,15 unused.</text>
<text x="243.84" y="111" size="1.016" layer="97" font="vector">Cable/contact orientation must match peripheral.</text>
