<text x="292.1" y="60.96" size="1.016" layer="98" font="vector">P4 GPIO1 TX -&gt; C6 RX</text>
<text x="292.1" y="58.42" size="1.016" layer="98" font="vector">P4 GPIO13 RX &lt;- C6 TX</text>
<text x="292.1" y="55.88" size="1.016" layer="98" font="vector">P4 GPIO0 -&gt; C6 BOOT9</text>
<text x="292.1" y="53.34" size="1.016" layer="98" font="vector">P4 GPIO54 -&gt; C6 EN</text>
<text x="292.1" y="50.8" size="1.016" layer="98" font="vector">GPIO8 high; BOOT9 low at reset.</text>
